The '''Bits Shop''', accessible at [[Elizabeth]] in the [[Community Center]], allows players to purchase exclusive, powerful items for {{Bits}}. Bits are only acquirable after consuming a [[Booster Cookie]].

== Items ==
Note that while this table can give a good estimate for the value of Bits Shop items, given the instability of [[Bazaar]] prices and the differences in supply and demand of the items themselves, items will likely be priced differently over time. Furthermore, the cost of [[sacks]] rely on an estimate of {{Bits}} to {{Coins}} at {{Bits to Coins|1}} each, as they cannot be sold on [[Bazaar]] nor the [[Auction House]].
